T:convey
T:meaning,
T:both in
T:spoken and
T:signed
T:forms, and
T:may also be
T:conveyed
T:through
T:writing.
T:Human
T:language is
T:characterize
T:by its
T:cultural and
T:historical
T:diversity,
T:with
T:significant
T:variations
T:observed
T:between
T:cultures and
T:across time.
